tic AI systems and 'AI employee' bots that autonomously execute multi-step real-world tasks—sales, operations, scheduling, continuous monitoring—on a user's or business's behalf, as distinct from coding-specific tooling or company business news.\",\"include\":[\"Autonomous agents running end-to-end business operations (selling, underwriting, coaching staff)\",\"AI 'bots' that log into a user's tools and complete tasks independently and return finished work\",\"Agents that learn a user's workflows and operate unattended ('works while you sleep')\",\"Comparative reviews of competing agent platforms as general-purpose digital teammates\",\"Speculative descriptions of always-on AI assistants continuously watching screens or meetings\"],\"exclude\":[\"Coding-specific IDE/agent-harness tutorials belong to Developer Tools, not this shelf\",\"Company funding, pricing, or market-position claims about the agent vendor belong to AI Industry and Business\",\"Jokes/memes about agent products without describing what the agent actually does belong to AI Culture and Commentary\"],\"sibling_cues\":[{\"include_cue\":\"Autonomous agents running end-to-end business operations\",\"confusing_alternative\":\"AI Industry and Business (a company's AI-driven growth story)\",\"evidence_needed\":\"Quote must describe the agent performing the task (selling, underwriting) rather than investor/market commentary about the company\"},{\"include_cue\":\"AI bots that log into tools and complete tasks independently\",\"confusing_alternative\":\"Developer Tools (coding assistant)\",\"evidence_needed\":\"Quote must show the bot acting on general business tasks (NDAs, headcount), not code editors or IDEs\"},{\"include_cue\":\"Agents that learn workflows and operate unattended\",\"confusing_alternative\":\"AI Industry and Business (marketing claim about a product)\",\"evidence_needed\":\"Quote must center on the agent's autonomous behavior/workflow execution, not pricing or company positioning\"},{\"inclu